We also have professional liability insurance covering up to 10,000,000 euros per claim and general civil liability cover. Certificates of insurance are available upon request, which will be important in contractual negotiations and ensuring we meet the client's requirements for risk management.

By leveraging our existing regulatory compliance framework, maintained by our Security & Compliance function, particularly for health deployments, and adhering strictly to the guidelines set forth by relevant authorities (such as GDPR, HDS, and EU AI Act), we can effectively manage legal risks associated with this project.
