We guarantee strict compliance with the GDPR, ensuring that health data is processed as special-category data (GDPR Art. 9) and medical confidentiality (secret médical) is preserved. Our hosting partner, OuraneCloud, uses renewable energy, has a power usage effectiveness (PUE) of 1.2, and reuses heat, minimizing the environmental footprint of our solution.

